# review/09-cap-and-borrowed-capture
profile own
scope.begin caller
scope.begin factory
new r R
new owner O hidden=r
cap view owner
exit.prepare factory view
scope.end factory
exit.commit factory caller
use view
new a A
bind a_bind a
closure f a
scope.begin inner
object stored action=f
use stored
scope.end inner
use a
scope.end caller
